#!/bin/bash
set -e
mkdir -p /etc/skel/Desktop
cat >/etc/skel/Desktop/README-VyronOS.txt <<'TXT'
Welcome to Bhupendra's Workstation

Operating system: Bhupendra VyronOS
Desktop: XFCE
Brand: Bhupendra

This is an initial workstation image. Confirm software configuration and security policies before storing sensitive data.
TXT
